    "description": "Collector Assembled\nMineral and Gemstone Specimen Collection\nNatural Minerals and Polished Stones in Display Cases\nDimensions: Large Case 14.5\" x 8.5\" x 2\"; Square Case 8\" x 8\" x 2.5\"\nUnsigned\nThis comprehensive mineral collection features two distinct display formats containing a variety of raw and tumbled geological specimens. The square shadowbox presents twelve raw specimens, each identified with gold-toned labels, including varieties such as Jadeite, Sodalite, Amethyst, and multiple forms of Quartz. The larger briefcase-style display case contains twenty-four recessed compartments, most housing individual clear containers for smaller tumbled stones and crystal points, ideal for educational study or decorative display.\nIncludes twelve labeled raw specimens: Guava Quartz, Jadeite, Orange Calcite, Aragonite, Sodalite, Amethyst, White Quartz, and Rose Quartz\nLarger professional-style display case features a textured faux-leather exterior with glass viewing lid and dual latches\nSquare 8x8 shadowbox frame includes a wall-mounting hanger and a slotted top for additional collection storage\nTotal weight of collection is 5.8 pounds\nCondition:\nGood overall condition. The mineral specimens are well-preserved and secure in their mounts. The large briefcase case shows moderate surface wear and scuffing to the black finish on the underside, but latches and hinges function correctly. The square shadowbox is in very good condition with minor handling wear.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so. Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nOur Business hours: Monday - Friday  8:00 am to 4:00 pm Central\nNew items and unique treasures are added daily, come back soon!",
